      "id": "t200267",
      "x": 82,
      "y": 1366,
      "width": 1130,
      "height": 96,
      "text": "no key list configured  \u2192  every route open (today's behaviour, unchanged)\nno rbac.toml  \u2192  built-in defaults, no behaviour change\ninert policy (a file, but no keys)  \u2192  warn once at startup\nreview mode without an admin key, or an unknown role / slug / version  \u2192  refuse to start",
      "originalText": "no key list configured  \u2192  every route open (today's behaviour, unchanged)\nno rbac.toml  \u2192  built-in defaults, no behaviour change\ninert policy (a file, but no keys)  \u2192  warn once at startup\nreview mode without an admin key, or an unknown role / slug / version  \u2192  refuse to start",
